flowchart TB
    Input[Validate CSV - upsert supplied daily keys] --> History[(Sales history)]
    History --> Eligible{35 or more days and latest within 90 days?}
    Eligible -->|No| Skip[Record skip reason]
    Eligible -->|Yes| Calendar[Calendarize missing days as zero]
    Calendar --> Split[Chronological raw-history split]
    Split --> Features[Past-only lag and rolling features]
    Features --> Forest[Train Random Forest on training dates]
    Forest --> Holdout[Recursively predict holdout without future actuals]
    Split --> Naive[Repeat training last seven days as baseline]
    Holdout --> Score[Compare MAE and RMSE]
    Naive --> Score
    Score --> Refit[Select by MAE and refit on all history]
    Refit --> Predict[Bridge stale dates and predict requested horizon]
    Predict --> Save[Save current forecasts and stock recommendations]
    Score --> Evidence[Append evaluation dates - predictions - metrics - limitations]
    Save --> Review[Human reviews recommendations]
